---

srtbench runs ffmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) as a child process for encoding,
decoding and full-reference quality measurement. ffmpeg is not distributed as
part of this source repository. The published container image is built on
linuxserver/ffmpeg and therefore includes an ffmpeg build under that project's
own licence terms.

---

The quality model is structured after ITU-T G.1070, and the audio term keeps
the Ie,eff structure of ITU-T G.107. The STRUCTURE is taken from those
standards; the COEFFICIENTS shipped with this project are not the published
table values and must not be cited as such. They are derived from stated
anchor points, and every one is labelled with its provenance at runtime.

See internal/qoe/defaults.go for the derivations, and run `srtbench profiles`
to print what each shipped profile actually claims about itself.
